        <mxCell id="R-Yf4d6ab7t9Y9P3JOOh-177" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;glass=0;shadow=0;fontSize=24;" value="I am running a hardened Debian 13 LXC that only allows &lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;56&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ssh login&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;56&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;via keys and &lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;79&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;no root login&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; allowed, plus I have installed all my favorite diagnostic tools." vertex="1">
